{"kind": "mod", "id": 918, "name": "BotDebug", "slug": "botdebug", "teaser": "A development utility for seeing what's going on with bots", "owner_name": "DrakiaXYZ", "downloads": 12777, "favourites": 6, "featured": false, "contains_ads": false, "contains_ai_content": false, "cheat_notice": false, "license_name": null, "guid": "xyz.drakia.botdebug", "thumbnail_local": null, "category": "Tools", "category_id": 1, "updated_at": "2026-08-03T06:02:26.000000Z", "created_at": "2023-06-11T19:14:31.000000Z", "published_at": "2023-06-11T19:14:00.000000Z", "latest_constraint": "~4.1.0", "latest_version": "1.8.0", "has_local": false, "has_github": false, "license_link": null, "description_html": "<p>This is a development utility for working with bots, allowing you to see some internal state variables of the bot in real time while in game.</p>\n<h3>This is a development tool, DO NOT LEAVE IT INSTALLED, it will cause crashes if used for extended periods of time</h3>\n<h3>Installation</h3>\n<p><strong>BotDebug depends on BigBrain to function:</strong> <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/1219-bigbrain/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">BigBrain</a></p>\n<p>1) Open the downloaded zip file in 7-zip</p>\n<p>2) Select the folders in the zip file in 7-zip</p>\n<p>3) Drag the selected folders from 7-zip into your SPT folder</p>\n<p>Demonstration Video (Yes, it’s Quest Tracker, but the same concept applies to all of my mods, I’m not making mod-specific extraction example videos):</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/afNPjAw.gif\" alt=\"Install Gif\" /></p>\n<h3>Usage</h3>\n<p>When enabled in the F12 menu, all bots active on the map will have a box drawn above them. This box will show internal bot information such as what brain and layer are active, whether the bot is friendly, etc.</p>\n<p>There are multiple panels that can be switched through using hot keys (Default F9 and F10)</p>\n<p>You can specify how close bots have to be for their label to draw in the F12 menu</p>\n<h3>Special Thanks</h3>\n<p>Thanks to Props for the original code this mod was based on, this was the kick start I needed to actually write this up</p>\n<p>If you enjoy my work, you can <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://ko-fi.com/drakiaxyz\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">feed my caffeine addiction</a></p>\n", "versions": [{"version": "1.2.1", "spt_version_constraint": "3.7.1", "content_length": null, "downloads": 431, "published_at": "2023-10-14T20:23:12.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/918/botdebug/1.2.1", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "1.2.2", "spt_version_constraint": "3.7.6", "content_length": null, "downloads": 1498, "published_at": "2023-10-29T19:03:27.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/918/botdebug/1.2.2", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "1.3.0", "spt_version_constraint": "3.8.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 2416, "published_at": "2024-04-01T21:20:00.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/918/botdebug/1.3.0", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "1.4.0", "spt_version_constraint": "3.9.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 1577, "published_at": "2024-07-06T19:18:46.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/918/botdebug/1.4.0", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "1.5.0", "spt_version_constraint": "3.10.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 1101, "published_at": "2024-11-27T05:14:39.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/918/botdebug/1.5.0", "g